{"n":16,"title":"Hidden talents","blurb":"Говорить, что вы умеете и не умеете","steps":[{"stage":"Warm-up","type":"note","title":"Hidden talents","sub":"","html":"<p>Что ты умеешь и не умеешь — и попугай Мёрфи, который ненавидит одну песню Beatles.</p><ul class=\"cp-aims\"><li>Говорить, что вы умеете</li><li>Говорить, чего вы не умеете</li><li>Спрашивать Can you…?</li></ul>"},{"stage":"Warm-up","type":"pick","title":"Что вы умеете? Выберите.","sub":"Здесь нет неправильного ответа.","options":[{"label":"drive"},{"label":"cook"},{"label":"swim"},{"label":"sing"},{"label":"draw"},{"label":"type fast"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"swim","ru":"плавать","kk":"жүзу","def":"I can swim well.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/b89f90f328fa.mp3"},{"en":"drive","ru":"водить машину","kk":"көлік жүргізу","def":"I can't drive.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/4979d619a7b7.mp3"},{"en":"cook","ru":"готовить","kk":"тамақ пісіру","def":"Can you cook?","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/f3ba4d993e2d.mp3"},{"en":"sing","ru":"петь","kk":"ән айту","def":"Murphy can sing.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/f9bef9c232ce.mp3"},{"en":"dance","ru":"танцевать","kk":"билеу","def":"He likes to dance.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/74b518ed5512.mp3"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"match","title":"Соедините слово и перевод.","sub":"","pairs":[{"left":"swim","right":"плавать"},{"left":"drive","right":"водить машину"},{"left":"cook","right":"готовить"},{"left":"sing","right":"петь"},{"left":"draw","right":"рисовать"},{"left":"type","right":"печатать"}],"options":["готовить","рисовать","петь","печатать","водить машину","плавать"]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"draw","ru":"рисовать","kk":"сурет салу","def":"My sister can draw very well.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/76a4e12c213d.mp3"},{"en":"type","ru":"печатать","kk":"теру","def":"She can type fast.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/d0a3e7f81a98.mp3"},{"en":"ride","ru":"ездить (на велосипеде)","kk":"міну (велосипед)","def":"He can ride a bicycle.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/320ef6a3e22f.mp3"},{"en":"speak","ru":"говорить (на языке)","kk":"сөйлеу (тілде)","def":"She can speak three languages.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/a65265946e25.mp3"},{"en":"play","ru":"играть","kk":"ойнау","def":"I can play the guitar.","img":null,"audio":null}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"note","title":"Насколько хорошо?","sub":"","html":"<table class=\"cp-table\"><tr><th></th><th>Предложение</th><th>Значение</th></tr><tr><td>+</td><td>She can type fast.</td><td>very good</td></tr><tr><td>+</td><td>I can swim well.</td><td>good</td></tr><tr><td>–</td><td>He speaks French badly.</td><td>not good</td></tr><tr><td>–</td><td>He reads very slowly.</td><td>not fast</td></tr></table><p>Слово стоит <b>после</b> глагола: I swim <b>well</b>.</p><p><b>Good</b> — про человека или предмет, <b>well</b> — про действие.</p><p>Противоположности: fast – slowly, well – badly.</p>"},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"phrases","title":"Послушайте два предложения.","sub":"Одно — «да», другое — «нет».","items":[{"text":"I can swim well.","src":null},{"text":"I can't drive.","src":null}]},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"can / can't","sub":"","html":"<table class=\"cp-table\"><tr><th>Лицо</th><th>Утверждение</th><th>Отрицание</th></tr><tr><td>I</td><td>I can swim.</td><td>I can't drive.</td></tr><tr><td>You</td><td>You can cook.</td><td>You can't sing.</td></tr><tr><td>He / She</td><td>She can type fast.</td><td>He can't swim.</td></tr><tr><td>They</td><td>They can dance.</td><td>They can't play tennis.</td></tr></table><p><b>can</b> одинаков для всех лиц — без <b>-s</b>: she <b>can</b>.</p><p>После can нет <b>to</b>: I can <b>swim</b>, а не «can to swim».</p><p><b>can't</b> = cannot. В речи говорят <b>can't</b>.</p>"},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"Can you…?","sub":"","html":"<table class=\"cp-table\"><tr><th>Вопрос</th><th>Да</th><th>Нет</th></tr><tr><td>Can you swim?</td><td>Yes, I can.</td><td>No, I can't.</td></tr><tr><td>Can she drive?</td><td>Yes, she can.</td><td>No, she can't.</td></tr><tr><td>Can I sit here?</td><td>Yes, of course.</td><td>Sorry, it's taken.</td></tr></table><p>Вопрос начинается с <b>Can</b>: Can you drive?</p><p><b>Can I…?</b> — просьба о разрешении: Can I sit here?</p><p><b>Can you…?</b> — ещё и просьба: Can you speak slowly?</p><p class=\"cp-note__fwd\">Can you repeat that? вы уже использовали в уроке 1.</p>"},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"Смотрите и слушайте.","sub":"","html":"","examples":["I can play the guitar.","I can't sing.","She can type very fast.","Can you drive?","No, I can't. But I can learn.","Can I sit here?"]},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"She ___ swim well.","options":["cans","can","can to"],"answer":"can","why":"can никогда не получает -s.","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"I ___ drive. I haven't got a car.","options":["don't can","can't","not can"],"answer":"can't","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"He can","after":"fast.","answers":["type"],"bank":["to type","type","types"],"why":"После can глагол без изменений.","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"— Can you swim?","options":["Yes, I do.","Yes, I can.","Yes, I am."],"answer":"Yes, I can.","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"— Can she drive?","options":["No, she can't.","No, she doesn't.","No, she isn't."],"answer":"No, she can't.","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"— Can I take this chair?","options":["Yes, I can.","Sorry, it's taken.","No, I don't."],"answer":"Sorry, it's taken.","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"Murphy","after":"sing and speak.","answers":["can"],"bank":["can","cans","can to"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"I","after":"play tennis well.","answers":["can't"],"bank":["can't","don't can","not can"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"","after":"you speak slowly, please?","answers":["Can"],"bank":["Do","Are","Can"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"cols","title":"Умение или разрешение?","sub":"","columns":["Я умею","Можно мне?"],"items":[{"text":"Can I take this chair?","col":1},{"text":"Can I have some water?","col":1},{"text":"Can I sit here?","col":1},{"text":"I can swim.","col":0},{"text":"She can type fast.","col":0},{"text":"He can't drive.","col":0}]},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["the","I","play","can","guitar."],"answer":"I can play the guitar.","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["She","not","can","drive","car.","a"],"answer":"She can not drive a car.","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["Can","speak","you","French?"],"answer":"Can you speak French?","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["She","cans","type","fast."],"bad":1,"answer":"She can type fast.","why":"У can нет -s."},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["I","can","to","swim."],"bad":2,"answer":"I can swim.","why":"После can нет to."},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["He","doesn't","can","drive."],"bad":1,"answer":"He can't drive.","why":"Отрицание can — can't."},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"Кто такой Мёрфи?","src":"/course/a0/audio/b4825eae0f68.mp3","options":["a dog","a parrot","a neighbour"],"answer":"a parrot","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"Что умеет Мёрфи?","src":"/course/a0/audio/b4825eae0f68.mp3","options":["sing and speak","drive and cook","read and write"],"answer":"sing and speak","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"gap","title":"Послушайте. Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"He likes","after":".","answers":["dancing"],"bank":["dancing","cooking","driving"],"src":"/course/a0/audio/b4825eae0f68.mp3"},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"— Can you swim?","src":"/course/a0/audio/e1537d6c0582.mp3","options":["Yes, I can. I can swim well.","No, I can't.","Yes, but badly."],"answer":"Yes, I can. I can swim well.","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"— And can you drive?","src":"/course/a0/audio/f9086c7cd881.mp3","options":["Yes, I can.","No, I can't. But I can learn.","Yes, I drive every day."],"answer":"No, I can't. But I can learn.","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"gap","title":"Послушайте. Дополните ответ.","sub":"","before":"— Can you use a camera? — Yes, I","after":".","answers":["can"],"bank":["can","do","am"],"src":"/course/a0/audio/81582574a731.mp3"},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"Как он читает?","src":"/course/a0/audio/d57edea6e79e.mp3","options":["fast","very slowly","well"],"answer":"very slowly","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"gap","title":"Послушайте. Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"She can type","after":".","answers":["fast"],"bank":["fast","slowly","badly"],"src":"/course/a0/audio/36dea9f16b5b.mp3"},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"Что вы слышите?","src":"/course/a0/audio/be3e7151016c.mp3","options":["I can play tennis well.","I can't play tennis well."],"answer":"I can't play tennis well.","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"О чём он просит?","src":"/course/a0/audio/74369c571d16.mp3","options":["Can you help me?","Can you speak slowly?","Can I have some water?"],"answer":"Can you speak slowly?","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"note","title":"Прочитайте про Ару.","sub":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Aru</p><p>Hi! I'm Aru. I can play the guitar, but I can't sing.</p><p>I can drive, and I drive to work every day.</p><p>My brother can't drive. He can ride a bicycle very well.</p><p>Can you cook? I can cook, but I don't cook often.</p>"},{"stage":"Listening","type":"choice","title":"True или False?","sub":"","prompt":"Aru can play the guitar.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"True","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Aru</p><p>Hi! I'm Aru. I can play the guitar, but I can't sing.</p><p>I can drive, and I drive to work every day.</p><p>My brother can't drive. He can ride a bicycle very well.</p><p>Can you cook? I can cook, but I don't cook often.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Listening","type":"choice","title":"True или False?","sub":"","prompt":"Her brother can drive.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"False","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Aru</p><p>Hi! I'm Aru. I can play the guitar, but I can't sing.</p><p>I can drive, and I drive to work every day.</p><p>My brother can't drive. He can ride a bicycle very well.</p><p>Can you cook? I can cook, but I don't cook often.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Listening","type":"gap","title":"Прочитайте ещё раз. Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"She can cook, but she","after":"cook often.","answers":["doesn't"],"bank":["isn't","can't","doesn't"],"why":"Она умеет готовить — здесь речь о частоте.","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Aru</p><p>Hi! I'm Aru. I can play the guitar, but I can't sing.</p><p>I can drive, and I drive to work every day.</p><p>My brother can't drive. He can ride a bicycle very well.</p><p>Can you cook? I can cook, but I don't cook often.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Speaking","type":"write","title":"Напишите о своих умениях.","sub":"Два умения и одно неумение.","placeholder":"","html":"<ul class=\"cp-frames\"><li>I can ___ .</li><li>I can ___ , but not very well.</li><li>I can't ___ .</li></ul><div class=\"cp-note__chips\"><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">I can</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">I can't</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">swim</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">drive</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">cook</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">sing</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">draw</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">play the guitar</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">well</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">badly</span></div>","modelHtml":"<ul class=\"cp-checks\"><li>После <b>can</b> у глагола нет <b>to</b> и <b>-s</b>.</li><li>В отрицании есть <b>can't</b>.</li><li><b>well</b> и <b>badly</b> стоят после глагола.</li></ul>"},{"stage":"Speaking","type":"record","title":"Произнесите предложения. Запишите и послушайте.","sub":"В can't гласный звучит длиннее.","items":["I can swim well.","I can't drive.","Can you cook?","Yes, I can."]},{"stage":"Wrap","type":"checklist","title":"Урок 16 пройден","sub":"Урок 16 из 24 · Юнит 4 пройден","items":["Я могу сказать, что умею.","Я могу сказать, чего не умею.","Я могу спросить Can you…? и Can I…?"]}]}
